WEBVTT

00:01:28.159 --> 00:01:31.221
called nociceptors, fire and send signals

00:01:31.245 --> 00:01:34.172
to the spinal cord
and then up to the brain.

00:01:34.196 --> 00:01:38.504
Processing work gets done
by cells called neurons and glia.

00:01:38.528 --> 00:01:40.481
This is your Grey matter.

00:01:40.505 --> 00:01:44.819
And brain superhighways carry information
as electrical impulses

00:01:44.843 --> 00:01:46.568
from one area to another.

00:01:46.592 --> 00:01:48.121
This is your white matter.

00:01:48.145 --> 00:01:51.423
The superhighway that carries
pain information

00:01:51.447 --> 00:01:53.368
from the spinal cord to the brain

00:01:53.392 --> 00:01:55.121
is our sensing pathway

00:01:55.145 --> 00:01:56.830
that ends in the cortex,

00:01:56.854 --> 00:01:59.107
a part of the brain
that decides what to do

00:01:59.131 --> 00:02:00.193
with the pain signal.